    <task id="Id_d0c9315b-67b6-41c0-bd99-346f97292d96" name="5.1.4 Estabelecer os padrões de informação">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Ao estabelecer o padr&amp;atilde;o de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es, a contratante considera:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;a) Troca de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es: Quais elementos padronizados para a troca de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es foram estabelecidos para o projeto.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Por exemplo, o padr&amp;atilde;o de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es pode estabelecer c&amp;oacute;digos espec&amp;iacute;ficos do projeto para apoiar a conven&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de nomenclatura do cont&amp;ecirc;iner de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es do anexo nacional e os valores permitidos para os campos de metadados. Ele tamb&amp;eacute;m pode especificar os sistemas de nomenclatura e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;numera&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o para elementos como: Componentes, tipos, sistemas, andares e espa&amp;ccedil;os.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;b) Estrutura&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e classifica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o das informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es: Quais estruturas de divis&amp;atilde;o de trabalho e sistema(s) de classifica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o foram estabelecidos para o projeto.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Por exemplo, o padr&amp;atilde;o de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es pode estabelecer uma estrutura de divis&amp;atilde;o de trabalho com base em um sistema de classifica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, um cronograma de pacotes ou outros crit&amp;eacute;rios.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;c) M&amp;eacute;todo de especifica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do n&amp;iacute;vel de necessidade de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es: Qual m&amp;eacute;todo de descri&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do n&amp;iacute;vel de necessidade de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es foi estabelecido para o projeto. Por exemplo, o padr&amp;atilde;o de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o pode estabelecer que a conven&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de n&amp;iacute;vel de defini&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o deve ser usada.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;d) Uso das informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es durante a fase operacional: Quais elementos padronizados para uso operacional foram estabelecidos para o projeto.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Por exemplo, o padr&amp;atilde;o de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es pode estabelecer informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es adicionais que devem ser incorporadas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
