    <task id="Id_1660a326-3940-4d26-8e48-02bdd7041ce2" name="5.1.5 Estabelecer os métodos e procedimentos">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Ao estabelecer os m&amp;eacute;todos e procedimentos de produ&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es, acontratante considera:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;a) Captura de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es sobre ativos existentes: Como as informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es existentes ser&amp;atilde;o capturadas. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Por exemplo, os m&amp;eacute;todos e procedimentos de produ&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es podem estabelecer quais propriedades precisam ser capturadas sobre as informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es de ativos existentes, os valores permitidos ou as unidades de medi&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o. Tamb&amp;eacute;m podem especificar em qual(is) cont&amp;ecirc;iner(es) de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es essas informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es s&amp;atilde;o capturadas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;b) Gera&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, revis&amp;atilde;o ou aprova&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de novas informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es: Como as informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es s&amp;atilde;o produzidas, revisadas ou aprovadas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Por exemplo, os m&amp;eacute;todos e procedimentos de produ&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es podem estabelecer que as informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es devem ser produzidas em um aplicativo de software espec&amp;iacute;fico. Tamb&amp;eacute;m pode especificar como revisar as informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es, fornecendo um procedimento ou um fluxo de trabalho espec&amp;iacute;fico a ser seguido.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;c) Seguran&amp;ccedil;a ou distribui&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es: Como implementar requisitos de seguran&amp;ccedil;a espec&amp;iacute;ficos ou como compartilhar informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Por exemplo, os m&amp;eacute;todos e procedimentos de produ&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es podem estabelecer que metadados adicionais relacionados a uma classifica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de seguran&amp;ccedil;a devem ser aplicados a todos os cont&amp;ecirc;ineres de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es. Tamb&amp;eacute;m pode especificar a solu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de ambiente comum de dados (CDE) a ser usada para a distribui&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;d) Entrega de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es: Como as informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es s&amp;atilde;o fornecidas &amp;agrave; contratante.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Por exemplo, os m&amp;eacute;todos e procedimentos de produ&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es podem estabelecer o procedimento a ser seguido na entrega de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es, como, por exemplo, se s&amp;atilde;o necess&amp;aacute;rias verifica&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es adicionais ou se deve ser usada uma solu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o CDE adicional.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#E5B9B7" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="borderColor" value="#956967" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textColor" value="#000000" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textBackgroundColor" value="Transparent" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textDirection" value="" />
          </bizagi:BizagiProperties>
        </bizagi:BizagiExtensions>
      </extensionElements>
      <incoming>Id_dd8aeba2-0d2d-4ae3-b67c-7191ac69f437</incoming>
      <outgoing>Id_3dda3236-b4eb-4f21-9267-c858d0a18121</outgoing>
      <ioSpecification id="Id_4d2ab056-8273-4234-bd55-0906c9a87d68">
        <inputSet id="Id_6659f3af-759c-47e7-9655-3ead0b0e6be7" />
        <outputSet id="Id_fdaa3bfc-128b-4ea7-960c-9ed3d0e789c4" />
      </ioSpecification>
      <resourceRole id="Id_032e32c0-e709-4135-9634-af5f21b438d1">
        <q7:resourceRef xmlns="" xmlns:q7="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL">EnteFederativo</q7:resourceRef>
      </resourceRole>
      <resourceRole id="Id_e6206092-8931-4d8e-a5aa-64e31e2b1027">
        <q8:resourceRef xmlns="" xmlns:q8="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL">FNDE</q8:resourceRef>
      </resourceRole>
    </task>
    <task id="Id_625ea26b-6e3b-4003-8198-493c72a881dd" name="5.1.6 Estabelecer as referências e recursos">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;A contratante deve considerar informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es de refer&amp;ecirc;ncia existentes e os recursos compartilhados para apoiar a proposta de todas as partes indicadas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;As informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es de refer&amp;ecirc;ncia podem ser relevantes para o projeto geral, como dados do terreno e entorno, sondagens do solo, ou informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es relacionadas a ativos adjacentes e/ou servi&amp;ccedil;os p&amp;uacute;blicos de propriedade de outras organiza&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;As informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es de refer&amp;ecirc;ncia tamb&amp;eacute;m podem ser informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es selecionadas do modelo de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es de ativos existente, como esquemas ou layouts de &amp;aacute;gua quente e &amp;aacute;gua fria a serem usados em um projeto de reforma de escrit&amp;oacute;rio.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Al&amp;eacute;m disso, as informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es de refer&amp;ecirc;ncia podem incluir as informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es fornecidas durante um contrato anterior, geralmente por uma equipe de entrega diferente. Por exemplo, especifica&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es de desempenho ou modelos preparadas pela equipe de projeto de um contrato de projeto e constru&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;O n&amp;atilde;o fornecimento de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es de refer&amp;ecirc;ncia significa que as poss&amp;iacute;veis licitantes provavelmente incluir&amp;atilde;o os custos para ger&amp;aacute;-las, ou incluir&amp;atilde;o um subs&amp;iacute;dio de risco em seus pre&amp;ccedil;os, ou ambos. Como alternativa, por ignor&amp;acirc;ncia, elas podem prosseguir com base em informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es de refer&amp;ecirc;ncia incompletas que, em &amp;uacute;ltima an&amp;aacute;lise, podem afetar a qualidade de seus produtos, sem culpa pr&amp;oacute;pria. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Os recursos compartilhados podem assumir v&amp;aacute;rias formas, como modelos de documentos, bibliotecas de objetos 3D ou estilos de linha personalizados, e a cl&amp;aacute;usula 5.1.6 fornece exemplos.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;a) informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es de ativos exisntentes;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;b) recursos compartilhados - padr&amp;otilde;es de bibliotecas, padr&amp;otilde;es de estilos, padr&amp;otilde;es de cont&amp;ecirc;ineres;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;c) objetos de bibliotecas definidos em normas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#E5B9B7" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="borderColor" value="#956967" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textColor" value="#000000" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textBackgroundColor" value="Transparent" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textDirection" value="" />
          </bizagi:BizagiProperties>
        </bizagi:BizagiExtensions>
      </extensionElements>
      <incoming>Id_2d2f8e02-1464-4834-81d3-aad7451f3a0f</incoming>
      <outgoing>Id_9783ad09-7d7a-4b3d-b768-bdeb73fc9a88</outgoing>
      <ioSpecification id="Id_037c3f69-296e-4fba-b31a-f6636e52776e">
        <inputSet id="Id_7900fb30-ea35-43cc-bfee-4fcbc7b3e2af" />
        <outputSet id="Id_3e3b7857-aa44-4176-b4e1-2ff699a0f460" />
      </ioSpecification>
      <resourceRole id="Id_84060168-fcd5-4eb4-823f-7c4e778ad25b">
        <q9:resourceRef xmlns="" xmlns:q9="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL">EnteFederativo</q9:resourceRef>
      </resourceRole>
    </task>
    <task id="Id_b3c61d43-487e-44db-85da-d940e0a66493" name="5.1.7 Estabelecer o CDE">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Antes que qualquer informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o possa ser trocada entre a contratante e sua(s) equipe(s) de entrega, um conjunto de fluxos de trabalho e solu&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es de troca deve ser acordado e implementado para formar o ambiente comum de dados (CDE). Um fluxo de trabalho pode, por exemplo, incluir o processo de aprova&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e os prazos, e uma solu&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o pode ser um sistema de gerenciamento de arquivos.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;A contratante deve: implementar o CDE, configurar o CDE do projeto; Atribuir responsabilidades e gestores da infomra&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o; dar suporte e treinamento aos envolvidos.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;O CDE deve permitir:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; Cada cont&amp;ecirc;iner de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es deve ter uma identifica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o exclusiva, com base em uma conven&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o acordada e documentada, composta de campos separados por um delimitador.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; Cada campo deve receber um valor de um padr&amp;atilde;o de codifica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o acordado e documentado. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; Cada cont&amp;ecirc;iner de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es deve ter os seguintes atributos atribu&amp;iacute;dos: 1) status 2) revis&amp;atilde;o 3) classifica&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; A capacidade dos cont&amp;ecirc;ineres de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es de fazer a transi&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o entre estados e o registro do nome do usu&amp;aacute;rio e da data em que as revis&amp;otilde;es do cont&amp;ecirc;iner de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es fazem a transi&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o entre cada estado &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; Acesso controlado em um n&amp;iacute;vel de cont&amp;ecirc;iner de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#E5B9B7" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="borderColor" value="#956967" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textColor" value="#000000" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textBackgroundColor" value="Transparent" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textDirection" value="" />
          </bizagi:BizagiProperties>
        </bizagi:BizagiExtensions>
      </extensionElements>
      <incoming>Id_d7af5ac6-0e2d-488b-abd6-61d27f76ed9c</incoming>
      <outgoing>Id_1dcb4d70-7985-41a8-bdbd-4ea0dab7b696</outgoing>
      <ioSpecification id="Id_fdf4ca88-1689-4d49-8cda-a664cbc0b271">
        <inputSet id="Id_12481e83-c389-4d9e-86d3-3dd79180b2e8" />
        <outputSet id="Id_f4aabcda-184b-4a95-8403-2a818902e332" />
      </ioSpecification>
      <resourceRole id="Id_44be4eaf-b729-4858-b0c1-4c400c2e8d7d">
        <q10:resourceRef xmlns="" xmlns:q10="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL">EnteFederativo</q10:resourceRef>
      </resourceRole>
    </task>
    <task id="Id_5afa9bec-12f3-4fdf-ad7f-f9dd1d790589" name="5.1.8 Estabelecer o protocolo">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;A contratante deve estabelecer um protocolo de infomra&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do projeto.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;a) as obriga&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es espec&amp;iacute;ficas da contratante, das potenciais contratadas e potenciais subcontratadas relacionadas &amp;agrave; gest&amp;atilde;o ou produ&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o,incluindo o uso do ambiente comum de dados do projetos;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;b) quaisquer garantias ou responsabilidades associadas ao modelo de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do projeto;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;c) informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o sobre quaisquer direitos de propriedade intelectual aplic&amp;aacute;veis ao projeto;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;d) uso de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es existentes do ativo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;e) uso de recursos copartilhados;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;f) uso de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es durante o projeto, incluindo quaisquer termos de licenciamento associados; e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;g) o reuso de infomra&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o ap&amp;oacute;s a contrata&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o ou no evento de rescis&amp;atilde;o.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#E5B9B7" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="borderColor" value="#956967" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textColor" value="#000000" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textBackgroundColor" value="Transparent" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textDirection" value="" />
          </bizagi:BizagiProperties>
        </bizagi:BizagiExtensions>
      </extensionElements>
